# "You may": Bot1 declines with an Ornithopter there to copy, so Clone enters as itself, a 0/0 Shapeshifter, and is put
# into its owner's graveyard as a state-based action (CR 704.5f, the card's ruling). The Ornithopter it could have copied
# stays alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Clone
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
Bot1.Decline
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 1
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter
Bot1.Graveyard = Clone; Black Lotus
